{"id":"634778","name":"蒜泥芝麻酱拌茄子","author":"筠旸JY","authorId":"7345450","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/634778/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白茄子","amount":"三个"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝麻酱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜瓣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香醋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白茄子特别嫩，去蒂去皮洗净。","img":"images/634778/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用手掰成小块儿。","img":"images/634778/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内注水烧开。","img":"images/634778/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入茄子（平时都是蒸熟）。","img":"images/634778/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮至茄子变软。","img":"images/634778/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出过凉。","img":"images/634778/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"挤出水分。","img":"images/634778/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"芝麻酱加点白开水洩开，加少许香醋和盐调味。","img":"images/634778/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒜瓣捣成蒜泥，或剁碎都可以。","img":"images/634778/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"茄子，蒜泥，调好的芝麻酱一起放小盆里。","img":"images/634778/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀即可食用。","img":"images/634778/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/634778/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/634778/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}